- **Dynamic Beamforming:** Advanced beamforming techniques can dynamically adjust the beamforming weights to focus on the most critical directions, maintaining performance even when multiple elements fail.
- **Redundancy Management:** By integrating advanced beamforming with redundancy management strategies, the system can quickly adapt to element failures, ensuring continuous and reliable communication.
- **Environmental Adaptation:** These techniques can be designed to adapt to varying environmental conditions, providing robust performance in diverse scenarios.

