### Integrating Spectrum Reuse with ML and AI

1. **Spectrum Allocation Optimization**: ML can identify the most efficient spectrum reuse strategies by analyzing historical data and real-time traffic patterns. Genetic Algorithms can help find the best spectrum allocation configurations.
