3. Investigate alternative materials and technologies: Research and develop alternative materials and technologies that can improve the efficiency of SIW components and reduce insertion loss for larger arrays.

4. Optimize the array layout: Investigate different array layouts and configurations to minimize the impact of increased array size on efficiency while maintaining compactness.

